SAR KHULE KIS TARHA DARBAR ME JAYE ZAINAB<br>
AA MERE GHAZI TUJHE ROKAR BULAYE ZAINAB<br>
<br>
HAYE DARBAR SAJATE HAI SABHI AHLE SHAR<br>
ISLIYE ROK-RAKHA HAI HAME KAB SE DAR PAR<br>
KAISE ISS KARB SE AB KHUD KO CHIPAYE ZAINAB<br>
<br>
RAAT KI OSS HAI AUR DHOOP HAI DIN KI BHAYYA<br>
BE-RIDA HUM HAI YAHA SAR PA NAHI HAI SAAYA<br>
AB KAHAN AALE MOHAMMED KO CHUPAYE ZAINAB<br>
<br>
TEEN DIN HOGAYE SAB AHLE HARAM ROTE HAI<br>
DEKHNE HUM KO TAMASHAI JAMA HOTE HAI<br>
HO ZAMEEN SHAQ THO ZAMEEN ME HI SAMAYE ZAINAB<br>
<br>
GHAM SHAHEEDO KA HAR EK GAAM PA RULATA RAHA<br>
DARD PARDE KA HAMESHA MUJHE TADPATA RAHA<br>
EK HI DIL PE SITAM KITNE UTHAYE ZAINAB<br>
<br>
HUM PE BAZAR ME BARSATE THE ZALIM PATHAR<br>
WAAR KARTE THE DILON PAR HUME BAGHI KHEKAR<br>
SABR KARTI THI FAQAT SAR KO JHUKAYE ZAINAB<br>
<br>
HAI SAR-E-NAIZA JO SAR PYASE ALI ASGHAR KA<br>
HALQ PA USKE BHI QANJAR MAINE CHALTA DEKHA<br>
KISTARHA PAANI KO AB MUH SE LAGAYE ZAINAB<br>
<br>
PUSHT-E-SAJJAD PE BARSATA HAI ZALIM DURRE<br>
ZULM BEEMAR PE HOTA HAI MAI DEKHU KAISE<br>
MERE ABBAS KAHIN MAR HI NA JAYE ZAINAB<br>
<br>
BAAP KE SEENE PA SOTI THI SAKINA BHAYYA<br>
HAR GHADI GHAM SE TADAPTI HAIBYATEEMA BHAYYA<br>
QAKH PA KAISE BHALA USKO SULAYE ZAINAB<br>
<br>
MOUT KE HATH SE MAJBOOR HOON AYE SHEHZADI<br>
NEHER PE TADPI BAHUT YE KHEKAR YE LASH-E-GHAZI<br>
BAR-SARE DOSH-E-HAWA SUNKE SADAYE ZAINAB<br>
<br>
SAR-E-DARBAR THA EK KARB KA MANZAR JAVED<br>
KHOON ROTA RAHA GHAZI KA KATA SAR JAVED<br>
SISKIYA LEKE USSE JAB BHI BULAYE ZAINAB